# AV Asset Manager

- Stack: Laravel + Blade + Alpine + Tailwind + Sanctum + Spatie Permission + MariaDB (SQLite OK locally).
- TP brand colours via Tailwind `brand-*` tokens (`#00adb7`, black, white, charcoal). Minimal UI; mobile-first.
- Roles: `admin`, `inventory_manager`, `scanner`. Enforce with middleware/policies on mutating routes.
- Audit logs are immutable — never add update/delete endpoints or Eloquent updates for `AuditLog`.
- Phase 1 is online-only PWA. Do not add offline IndexedDB sync, Guest QR, RU visualiser, SSO, or maintenance galleries unless explicitly requested.
- Prefer services (`ScanService`, `ListComparisonService`) for stocktake logic. Keep controllers thin.
- No secrets in commits. Validate uploads (xlsx/csv/jpg/png/pdf/docx, 25MB).
- Follow existing naming: Asset, AssetList, ScanSession, custom field sets on ItemType.
